{"id": "98909463-7b4a-4fa6-93f1-05a7356de663", "title": {"en": "Eyes and Ears", "es": "Ojos y o\u00eddos", "pt": "Olhos e Ouvidos"}, "card": {"foregroundColor": {"blue": 1, "green": 1, "opacity": 1, "red": 1}, "image": "", "imageStyle": "textFirst", "localizedTitle": {"en": "### Eyes and Ears", "es": "### Ojos y o\u00eddos", "pt": "### Olhos e Ouvidos"}}, "pages": [{"id": "a8b2ab41-a8e2-4cf2-8f24-eb04b7c36bff", "blocks": [{"id": "b86d014a-ba8f-47f2-b93f-e2a27b262694", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Uganda", "es": "## Uganda"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "0d29b274-a601-4ff4-b443-023be4afd70b", "coordinateRegion": {"latitude": 0.9225759727202563, "latitudinalMeters": 7335267.502600738, "longitude": 30.22114164033284, "longitudinalMeters": 15649670.263945354}, "height": "regular", "type": "map"}, {"id": "a61a0ae9-09f2-4c55-90ac-8b19eed3cf7a", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Listen to this signal from an earthquake in NW Uganda, north of Lake Albert, near the border with the Democratic Republic of the Congo. If the octaves higher is not set to 8, do set it and listen again.", "es": "Escucha esta se\u00f1al de un terremoto en el noroeste de Uganda, norte del lago Albert, cerca del borde con la Rep\u00fablica Democr\u00e1tica del Congo. Si el incremento de octavas no es 8, selecci\u00f3nalo y escucha de nuevo.", "pt": "Escute este sinal de um terremoto no Noroeste da Uganda, ao norte do Lago Albert, pr\u00f3ximo \u00e0 fronteira com a Rep\u00fablica Democr\u00e1tica do Congo. Se o incremento de oitavas n\u00e3o estiver em 8, selecione este valor e escute novamente."}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "25d74e9e-d403-4647-be7f-db195a16df1a", "octavesHigher": 256, "type": "localWave", "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 1800, "startDate": "2021-03-20T17:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "example", "id": "66484BBE-27FA-4A22-BBE6-692EF3FBD707", "latitude": -0.6, "longitude": 30.74, "name": "Mbarara, Uganda", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "1999-09-22T00:00:00Z", "location": "00", "network": "II", "station": "MBAR"}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}, "timeLatency": 48}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}}}, {"id": "c6f79d07-bf12-4dce-9b12-75c1ec1b6dbc", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "It sounds pretty powerful, right?\n\nYet people near the epicenter would have felt light shaking at most from this\nmagnitude 4 earthquake that occurred 10 km underground.\n", "es": "Suena bastante potente, \u00bfno?\n\nSin embargo, las personas cercanas al epicentro de este terremoto, que ocurri\u00f3\na 10 km de profundidad, habr\u00edan sentido una ligera sacudida a lo sumo de una\nmagnitud 4.\n", "pt": "Parece bastante potente, n\u00e3o \u00e9?\n\nAinda assim, as pessoas pr\u00f3ximas ao epicentro deste terremoto de magnitude 4, \nque ocorreu a 10 km de profundidade, provavelmente sentiriam no m\u00e1ximo uma leve sacudida.\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "4aa241dc-27c0-478f-b8aa-adb931a51084", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": "", "type": "button"}], "title": "P1. Uganda"}, {"id": "158b928f-327c-4220-89bd-ac86cdbf814a", "blocks": [{"id": "a3d9f713-1966-41e8-af89-ddc27840aea4", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Botswana", "es": "## Botsuana", "pt": "## Botsuana"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "1060abff-216b-4d01-b56a-f4755c3a4585", "coordinateRegion": {"latitude": 0.9225759727202563, "latitudinalMeters": 7335267.502600738, "longitude": 30.22114164033284, "longitudinalMeters": 15649670.263945354}, "height": "regular", "type": "map"}, {"id": "fd63fa91-f1f0-462e-8b69-beb2c0700a11", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Now listen to the same half hour of data as recorded much further away,\nin Botswana. Also set the octaves higher to 8.\n", "es": "Ahora escucha la misma media hora de datos grabada mucho m\u00e1s lejos, en Botsuana.\n Comprueba que el incremento de octavas sea de 8.\n", "pt": "Agora escute a mesma meia hora de dados registrada em uma esta\u00e7\u00e3o que se encontra\n muito mais distante, na Botsuana. Certifique-se de que o incremento de oitavas esteja em 8.\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "e2d0377d-68b6-4b71-8b2f-3c31f90bc820", "octavesHigher": 256, "type": "localWave", "volumeModifier": "fixed", "waveData": {"duration": 1800, "startDate": "2021-03-20T17:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "example", "id": "6DA05A40-DB1F-42B3-9115-1CC0AFF91BF2", "latitude": -25.02, "longitude": 25.6, "name": "Lobatse, Botswana", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "2011-06-14T11:16:00Z", "location": "00", "network": "GT", "station": "LBTB"}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}}}, {"id": "11ad833f-0d20-4117-b15a-301a5781ce6e", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Questions", "es": "## Preguntas", "pt": "## Perguntas"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "47ac5f95-05bb-4c33-9a07-5f2d0f7c0922", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "**Question 1.** Do you see an earthquake signal or another signal above the \nbackground noise?\n", "es": "**Pregunta 1.** \u00bfVes una se\u00f1al de terremoto u otra se\u00f1al por encima del ruido de fondo?\n", "pt": "**Pergunta 1.** Voc\u00ea consegue ver um sinal de terremoto ou algum outro sinal acima do ru\u00eddo de fundo?\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "89b16281-a0ce-45aa-b9c4-5082a1fedd00", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "**No** is an acceptable answer\n", "es": "**No** es una respuesta aceptable\n", "pt": "**N\u00e3o** \u00e9 uma resposta aceit\u00e1vel\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false, "unveil": {"unveilText": {"en": "Unveil answer", "es": "Desvelar respuesta", "pt": "Revelar resposta"}, "waitingTime": 5}}, {"id": "a91cf519-9501-4dd0-938a-ba2913ae8c8e", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "**Question 2.** Do you hear any signals above the background noise?\n", "es": "**Pregunta 2.** \u00bfEscuchas alguna se\u00f1al por encima del ruido de fondo?\n", "pt": "**Pergunta 2.** Voc\u00ea consegue escutar algum sinal acima do ru\u00eddo de fundo?\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "673bc200-6d25-44f8-9468-0cd2df66aea4", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "**No** is an acceptable answer, but people with good speakers or earbuds \nmight hear something faint around two thirds of the way into the recording. \n\nIt\u2019s easier to hear when choosing the **auto-adjusted volume** setting, which \nadjusts the maximum volume to the maximum amplitude of the recording. \n\nIn this case it amplifies the recorded signals.\n", "es": "**No** es una respuesta aceptable, pero las personas con buenos altavoces \no auriculares podr\u00edan escuchar algo tenue alrededor de dos tercios de la onda.\n\nEs m\u00e1s f\u00e1cil de escuchar cuando se elige la configuraci\u00f3n de **volumen auto-ajustado**,\nque ajusta el volumen m\u00e1ximo a la amplitud m\u00e1xima de la grabaci\u00f3n.\n\nEn este caso, amplifica la onda grabada.\n", "pt": "**N\u00e3o** \u00e9 uma resposta aceit\u00e1vel, mas as pessoas com bons alto-falantes \nou fones de ouvidos talvez escutem algo suave por volta de dois ter\u00e7os da grava\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\nFica mais f\u00e1cil de ouvir ao escolher a op\u00e7\u00e3o de **volume ajustado automaticamente**, \nque ajusta o volume m\u00e1ximo de acordo com a amplitude m\u00e1xima da grava\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\nNeste caso, isso amplifica os sinais gravados.\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false, "unveil": {"unveilText": {"en": "Unveil answer", "es": "Desvelar respuesta", "pt": "Revelar resposta"}, "waitingTime": 5}}, {"id": "ae2cbc56-f26b-42ff-8724-5b57433abead", "action": "next", "localizedText": {"en": "Next", "es": "Siguiente", "pt": "Pr\u00f3ximo"}, "paramValue": "", "type": "button"}], "title": "P2. Botswana"}, {"id": "7014a6b9-a640-4f1e-832a-36a3d160b21d", "blocks": [{"id": "a99b1a06-a069-4333-897b-53650dabe97d", "height": "regular", "image": "", "type": "image"}, {"id": "08c21138-b4bd-4c10-9cd3-ca80d7f2c6e7", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Let\u2019s keep the octaves higher to 8 and increase the volume by pressing the\nround button with the wave in it. You should see the background noise much\nbetter now. Likely you still do not see a signal with your eyes. The earthquake\nsignal, if there, might be weaker than the noise. Can your ears hear the signal?\n", "es": "Mant\u00e9n el incremento de octavas en 8 y aumenta el volumen presionando el\nbot\u00f3n redondo con una onda en su interior. Deber\u00edas ver el ru\u00eddo de fondo\nmucho mejor ahora. Es probable que todav\u00eda no veas una se\u00f1al con tus ojos.\nLa se\u00f1al del terremoto, si es que existe, podr\u00eda ser m\u00e1s d\u00e9bil que el ruido.\n\u00bfPueden tus o\u00eddos escuchar la se\u00f1al?\n", "pt-br": "Vamos manter as oitavas mais altas em 8 e aumentar o volume pressionando o bot\u00e3o \nredondo com o desenho de uma onda. Agora voc\u00ea deve conseguir ver o ru\u00eddo de fundo muito melhor. \nProvavelmente, voc\u00ea ainda n\u00e3o consegue ver um sinal com os olhos. O sinal do terremoto, \nse estiver presente, pode ser mais fraco que o ru\u00eddo. Seus ouvidos conseguem perceber o sinal?\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "f45b9113-375e-428d-ab39-8456ac689a04", "octavesHigher": 256, "type": "localWave", "volumeModifier": "autoAdjusted", "waveData": {"duration": 1800, "startDate": "2021-03-20T17:00:00Z", "station": {"group": "example", "id": "6DA05A40-DB1F-42B3-9115-1CC0AFF91BF2", "latitude": -25.02, "longitude": 25.6, "name": "Lobatse, Botswana", "periods": [{"channel": "BHZ", "from": "2011-06-14T11:16:00Z", "location": "00", "network": "GT", "station": "LBTB"}], "preferredTimeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}, "timeLatency": 24}, "timeZone": {"identifier": "GMT", "style": "byGMTValue"}}}, {"id": "61f0e8c6-260c-4afe-be29-8c4389ed12fb", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "## Questions", "es": "## Preguntas", "pt": "## Perguntas"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": true}, {"id": "45e36f60-630a-4bb2-90c5-8a80ab08fd9f", "backgroundTransparent": false, "localizedText": {"en": "Your ears could have heard it, maybe about 10 minutes later \nthan where you heard it in Uganda?\n\nRemember that the record is 30 minutes long in all cases.\n\nThe Botswana station is about 2700 km away from the Uganda station.\n\nWith this information you can compute how fast the seismic waves traveled. \nHow much faster are they than the speed of sound in air (0.3 km/s)?\n\nAre they faster than airplanes?\n", "es": "Tus o\u00eddos han podido escuchar el terremoto, tal vez, unos 10 minutos m\u00e1s\ntarde de cuando se escuch\u00f3 en Uganda.\n\nRecuerda que el registro tiene una duraci\u00f3n de 30 minutos en los dos casos.\n\nLa estaci\u00f3n de Botsuana est\u00e1 a unos 2700 km de la estaci\u00f3n de Uganda.\n\nCon esta informaci\u00f3n puedes calcular qu\u00e9 tan r\u00e1pido viajaron las ondas s\u00edsmicas.\n\u00bfHan sido m\u00e1s r\u00e1pidas que la velocidad del sonido en el aire (0,3 km/s)?\n\n\u00bfSon m\u00e1s r\u00e1pidas que los aviones?\n", "pt": "Seus ouvidos poderiam t\u00ea-lo ouvido, talvez cerca de 10 minutos depois\nde quando voc\u00ea o ouviu em Uganda?\n\nLembre-se de que a grava\u00e7\u00e3o tem 30 minutos de dura\u00e7\u00e3o em todos os casos.\n\nA esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Botsuana fica a cerca de 2700 km da esta\u00e7\u00e3o de Uganda.\n\nCom essa informa\u00e7\u00e3o, voc\u00ea pode calcular a velocidade com que as ondas s\u00edsmicas viajaram.\nQu\u00e3o mais r\u00e1pidas elas s\u00e3o do que a velocidade do som no ar (0,3 km/s)?\n\nElas s\u00e3o mais r\u00e1pidas do que avi\u00f5es?\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false}, {"id": "5ae68447-5399-4b35-afbe-0b2b2f017f5f", "backgroundTransparent": true, "localizedText": {"en": "Scientists measure speeds in SI units of km/s, so the 10 minutes it took the \nwaves to travel 2700 km need to be converted to seconds (s). The speed is the \ndistance traveled divided by the time it took.\n\nPeople might relate more to units of km/hour or miles/hour. The speed of sound \nin air is about 1200 km/hour. At cruising altitude, commercial airplanes fly \na bit slower than that, but at least two thirds that speed.\n", "es": "Los cient\u00edficos miden las velocidades en unidades del SI de km/s, por lo que \nlos 10 minutos que tardaron las ondas en recorrer 2700 km necesitan convertirse \na segundos (s). La velocidad es la distancia recorrida dividida por el tiempo \nque tom\u00f3.\n\nLa gente podr\u00eda usar las unidades de km/hora o millas/hora. La velocidad del \nsonido en el aire es de aproximadamente 1200 km/hora. A altitud de crucero, \nlos aviones comerciales vuelan un poco m\u00e1s despacio que eso, pero al menos a \ndos tercios de esa velocidad.\n", "pt": "Cientistas medem velocidades em unidades do SI de km/s, ent\u00e3o os 10 minutos que as \nondas levaram para percorrer 2700 km precisam ser convertidos para segundos (s). \nA velocidade \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia percorrida dividida pelo tempo que levou.\n\nAs pessoas podem estar mais familiarizadas com unidades de km/h ou milhas/h. A velocidade \ndo som no ar \u00e9 de cerca de 1200 km/h. Em altitude de cruzeiro, avi\u00f5es comerciais voam \num pouco mais devagar do que isso, mas pelo menos a dois ter\u00e7os dessa velocidade.\n"}, "type": "markdown", "underlined": false, "unveil": {"unveilText": {"en": "Unveil answer", "es": "Desvelar respuesta", "pt": "Revelar resposta"}, "waitingTime": 5}}, {"id": "f357a64f-8d26-4c50-9244-13381e7052e6", "action": "close", "localizedText": {"en": "Close", "es": "Cerrar"}, "paramValue": "", "type": "button"}], "title": "P3. Compare"}]}